01:02:47.480 --> 01:02:55.290
<v Nita>They're not going to be open. OK, OK. First week of July. OK. OK, we got it. OK, we fill it up.
<v Nita>她们不会开放的。好的，好的。7月第一周。好的。好的，我们明白了。好的，我们填满它。

01:02:55.290 --> 01:02:55.830
<v Shannon Brewer>Fill it on up.
<v Shannon Brewer>填满它。

