<v Derenda Hancock>Yeah.
<v Derenda Hancock>是的。

01:03:30.230 --> 01:03:38.840
<v Maisie Crow>By the end of the day, they'd rearranged more things, called in other doctors, and even found a way to start booking new patients again too.
