01:06:58.520 --> 01:07:16.670
<v Ira Glass>Our managing editor is Sara Abdurrahman. Our senior editor is David Kestenbaum. Our executive editor is Emanuele Berry. Movie legend Carol Kane agreed to be the voice of our pill smuggler in Act 5 today. Maisie Crow's movie about abortion in Mississippi, which follows the Pink House and Shannon Brewer, is called Jackson. You can find it on HBO Max.
